@startuml UC-1-1-Oprette-henvisning
title UC 1.1 — Oprette en ny henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam ActorFontColor #4B3F8A
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteFontColor #1A7F8E

actor Henviser
actor Modtager

rectangle "Henvisning \n- ServiceRequest\n(status: proposed)" as SR #EEEAF7

Henviser -right-> SR : Send
SR -right-> Modtager : Modtag

note bottom of Henviser
  → UC 1.2 Tilknytte klinisk dokumentation (valgfrit)
end note

note bottom of Modtager
  → UC 2.1 Modtage og kvittere
end note
@enduml

@startuml UC-1-2-Tilknytte-dokumentation
title UC 1.2 — Tilknytte klinisk dokumentation

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6

actor Henviser

rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(eksisterende)" as SR #F5F5F5
rectangle "DiagnosticReport\nMedia / DocumentReference" as DOC #EEEAF7

Henviser -right-> SR : berig

DOC .bottom.> SR : reference

@enduml

@startuml UC-1-3-Aendre-henvisning
title UC 1.3 — Ændre en afsendt henvisning (Henvisers eget initiativ)

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6

actor Henviser

rectangle "Henvisning \n(ServiceRequest \nm. revision-flag)" as SR #EEEAF7

Henviser -right-> SR : send opdatering
SR -right-> Visitor : modtag opdatering

note bottom of Henviser
  → UC 1.3 Ændre henvisning 
end note

note bottom of Visitor
  → UC 2.2 Triagere og prioritere
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-1-4-Tilbagekalde-henvisning
title UC 1.4 — Tilbagekalde en henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A7A4A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F0F4F0

actor Henviser

rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(status: revoked)" as SR #FBF0EB

Henviser -right-> SR : send revokering
SR -right-> Visitor : modtag revokering

note bottom of Henviser
  Flowet afsluttes
end note

note bottom of Visitor
  Flowet afsluttes
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-1-5-Monitorere-status
title UC 1.5 — Monitorere status på afsendte henvisninger

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #EEEAF7

actor Henviser
rectangle "FHIR Endpoint\n(Visitator)" as EP #E6F4F6

Henviser -right-> EP : subscribe / poll
EP -left-> Henviser : SubscriptionStatus

note bottom of Henviser
  → UC 1.6 Modtage afgørelse
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-1-6-Modtage-afgoerelse
title UC 1.6 — Modtage afgørelse fra visitatoren

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #EEEAF7

actor Henviser
rectangle "Task / SubscriptionNotification\n(afgørelse)" as T #E6F4F6

T -right-> Henviser : levér afgørelse

note right of Henviser
  Accept → flowet afsluttes
  Afvisning → UC 1.1 Ny henvisning
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-2-1-Modtage-kvittere
title UC 2.1 — Modtage og kvittere for ny henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6

actor Visitator
rectangle "Bundle\n(ServiceRequest)" as B #EEEAF7

B -right-> Visitator : modtag
Visitator -left-> B : ACK (MessageHeader)

note bottom of Visitator
  → UC 2.2 Triagere og prioritere
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-2-2-Triagere-prioritere
title UC 2.2 — Triagere og prioritere en henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6

actor Visitator
rectangle "Task\n(triage-outcome, priority)" as T #E6F4F6

Visitator -right-> T : dokumentér udfald

note right of T
  Positiv → UC 2.3 Acceptere
  Negativ → UC 2.4 Afvise
  Utilstr. → UC 3.1 Supplement
  Prioritet → UC 2.6 Ændre prioritet
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-2-3-Acceptere-booke
title UC 2.3 — Acceptere en henvisning og booke forløb

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Visitator
rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(status: active)" as SR #E6F4F6
rectangle "Appointment\n(status: booked)" as AP #E6F4F6

Visitator -right-> SR : acceptér
SR -right-> AP : opret booking

note right of AP
  → UC 3.4 Statusnotifikation
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-2-4-Afvise-henvisning
title UC 2.4 — Afvise en henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Visitator
rectangle "Task\n(declined + reason)" as T #FBF0EB
rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(status: revoked)" as SR #FBF0EB

Visitator -right-> T : dokumentér afvisning
T -right-> SR : opdatér status

note right of SR
  → UC 3.4 Statusnotifikation
  (valgfrit) → UC 3.5 Alternativ visitation
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-2-5-Videresende
title UC 2.5 — Videresende til anden modtager

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6

actor Visitator
rectangle "ServiceRequest (orig.)" as ORIG #F5F5F5
rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(replaces: orig.)" as NEW #E6F4F6

Visitator -right-> NEW : opret med replaces-ref.
NEW ..> ORIG : replaces

note right of NEW
  → UC 2.1 (ny modtager)
  → UC 3.4 Statusnotifikation
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-2-6-Aendre-prioritet
title UC 2.6 — Ændre prioritet på en modtaget henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Visitator
rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(priority update)" as SR #E6F4F6
rectangle "SubscriptionNotification" as SN #FBF0EB

Visitator -right-> SR : opdatér prioritet
SR -right-> SN : udløs notifikation

note right of SN
  → UC 3.4 Statusnotifikation
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-3-1-Anmode-supplement
title UC 3.1 — Anmode om supplerende oplysninger

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Visitator
actor Henviser
rectangle "CommunicationRequest" as CR #FBF0EB

Visitator -right-> CR : opret anmodning
CR -right-> Henviser : send

note right of Henviser
  → UC 3.2 Besvare supplement
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-3-2-Besvare-supplement
title UC 3.2 — Besvare anmodning om supplement

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Henviser
actor Visitator
rectangle "Communication\n(in-response-to)" as C #FBF0EB

Henviser -right-> C : besvar
C -right-> Visitator : send supplement

note right of Visitator
  → UC 2.2 Triagere (genoptag)
  (valgfrit) → UC 3.3 Faglig afklaring
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-3-3-Faglig-afklaring
title UC 3.3 — Faglig afklaring i dialog

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Henviser
actor Visitator
rectangle "Communication [1]" as C1 #FBF0EB
rectangle "Communication [2]\n(in-response-to)" as C2 #FBF0EB
rectangle "Communication [n]\n(afgørelse)" as CN #FBF0EB

Visitator -right-> C1
C1 -right-> Henviser
Henviser -left-> C2
C2 -left-> Visitator
Visitator -right-> CN

note right of CN
  → UC 2.3 Acceptere
  → UC 2.4 Afvise
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-3-4-Statusnotifikation
title UC 3.4 — Statusnotifikation til henviser

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEEAF7
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #4B3F8A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #EEEAF7

actor Henviser
rectangle "SubscriptionNotification\n(statusskift)" as SN #FBF0EB

SN -right-> Henviser : push notifikation

note right of Henviser
  → UC 1.6 Modtage afgørelse
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-3-5-Alternativ-visitation
title UC 3.5 — Aftale om alternativ visitation

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF0EB

actor Visitator
actor Henviser
rectangle "Communication ↔" as C #FBF0EB
rectangle "Task\n(alternativ aftale)" as T #FBF0EB

Visitator -right-> C
C -right-> Henviser
Henviser -left-> C
C -down-> T : dokumentér aftale

note right of T
  → UC 1.1 Ny henvisning (alt. tilbud)
  → UC 2.3 Acceptere
end note

@enduml

@startuml UC-3-6-Korrektionsaftale
title UC 3.6 — Korrektionsaftale om fejl i afsendt henvisning

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #C75D3A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FBF0EB
skinparam noteBorderColor #1A7F8E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E6F4F6

actor Visitator
actor Henviser
rectangle "Communication\n(fejlmelding)" as C #FBF0EB
rectangle "ServiceRequest\n(PUT / korrektion)" as SR #EEEAF7

Visitator -right-> C : kontakt om fejl
C -right-> Henviser
Henviser -left-> SR : ret og PUT

note right of SR
  → UC 1.3 Ændre henvisning
  → UC 2.2 Triagere (genoptag)
end note

@enduml
